setDefaults
⍝ Establish defaults - Looking forward to ⎕VGET

 'MAXLOG'       default 2000
 'LOGMODES'     default ⎕A ⍝ Log everything (see Log)
 'LOGFILE'      default (2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetEnvironment' 'EWCLOGFILE')
 'UNSUPPORTED'  default 1 ⍝ On unsupported use: 0 silent, 1 report+collect, 2 error
 'UNSUPPORTEDLOG' default 'ewc-unsupported.log' ⍝ Where level 1 collects them
 'RESOURCES'    default 1 2⍴⊂''
 'PORT'         default 22322
 'PORTTRIES'    default 10 ⍝ Number of ports to try from PORT upwards
 'MAXSESSIONS'  default 100
 'BREAK'        default ⍬ ⍬ ⍝ IDs Events
 'SHOWDEVTOOLS' default 0
 'FONTMAP'      default FontMap
 'PLUGIN_TIMEOUT' default 30 ⍝ Seconds to wait while a plugin's JS loads
